OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 6 APR
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GRadio 3 New Generation Artist,
OL,11,     Gtenor Santiago Sanchez, in a live
OL,12,     Grecital from Wigmore Hall with
OL,13,     Gpianist Ian Tindale, plus Chopin
OL,14,     Gfrom LSO St Luke's and music
OL,15,     Ginspired by the past.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Gershwin
OL,17,     GDonald Macleod explores the early
OL,18,     Glife of George Gershwin, the
OL,19,     Gcomposer of the American 'melting
OL,20,     Gpot'.
